# Ticket name in mentions

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

When you refer to a board ticket, write the number **and** the issue title in the same phrase.

```text
#877 Admin portal UX redesign + improvements + mobile
```

Not `#877` alone. Not “ticket 877” without the name.

- Chat, recaps, risk lists, PR comments, and “want a progress comment on #N?” all use this form.
- If you do not have the title, run `gh issue view N --json title` before you mention it. Do not invent a title.
- After the first mention in a reply, later mentions in that same reply may use `#N` only.
